1
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:02,750
(Penny:)Still mad at me about that?

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:04,980
(Leonard:)No. No, I understand.

3
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:08,420
(Leonard:)I got too intense,
you had to back off.

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:11,020
(Bernadette:)Thank you.

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:14,060
(Leonard:)I've gotten a lot better
at that, you know.

6
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:17,630
(Leonard:)I've dated four different women
since we broke up

7
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:20,130
(Leonard:)and I didn't tell any of them
that I loved them

8
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:21,900
(Leonard:)and wanted
to have their babies.

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,730
(Bernadette:)Good for you.

10
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,640
(Leonard:)Okay, good night.

11
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,970
(Leonard:)Good night.

12
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:36,650
(Penny:)You know, maybe it wouldn't be
the worst idea in the world

13
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:39,980
(Penny:)to violate the Neutral Zone
for just one night.

14
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:41,520
(Howard:)Oh!

15
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:45,120
(Raj:)Hey, Leonard,
Sheldon kicked me

16
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:47,360
(Raj:)out of the room,
gave me your key.

17
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:49,760
(Leonard:)Penny's here.

18
00:00:53,600 --> 00:01:03,020
(Leonard:)No, we don't want to watch
Bridget Jones's Diary!

